      ],
      "source": "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Rancocas%2C_New_Jersey",
      "category": "history",
      "quality": "good"
    },
    {
      "id": 4,
      "text": "The Rancocas Creek was a busy transportation route from Mount Holly to the Delaware River and Philadelphia in the late 1700s and early 1800s.",
      "sourceSentenceIds": [
